  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "✨Introducing ~ Bumble Beach on 30A<br><br>There's a buzz going around, and it's all about Bumble Beach on 30A! This centrally located 3-bedroom, 2.5-bath home comfortably sleeps up to 9 guests and sits in the highly sought-after Prominence community on 30A. One of its standout features is its front-of-community location—just steps from the seasonally heated community pool and directly across the street from the local favorite, The Big Chill. With provided bikes and a 6-seater golf cart, getting out and exploring the area couldn't be easier.<br><br>Highlights ⇨ <br>✓ 6-seater golf cart<br>✓ 4 Custom Kalos bikes<br>✓ Easy, breezy beach access: We've got you covered with four convenient beach access points, each offering something unique! Our favorite is Deer Lake State Park, just 5 mins away via golf cart or bike. <br>✓ Open Concept Living. The home has been redesigned with beautiful plush couches and chairs, great for movie nights after a long beach day! <br>✓ Two Resort Style Pools - zero access entry is great for the kids! <br><br>📍Where you'll call home ~ <br>- The Prominence community has everything! 2 Resort style pools, outdoor space, outdoor grills, easy access to the beach, and quick stroll to The Big Chill. The Big Chill is a great family gathering place: entertainment like movies and concerts on the green, restaurants, and outdoor space for the family to hang. Perfect for evenings after the beach. <br><br>⛱️Beach Access ~ <br>- Deer Lake State Park A 5-minute bike ride or drive away, this stunning beach has parking, restrooms, and picnic spots. <br>- Gulf Lakes Beach Perfect for bike rides; a 6-minute ride with convenient access. <br>- Seabreeze Beach Access An easily accessible option with parking across 30A. A 4-minute drive from the property! <br>- Walton Dunes Beach Our favorite, with no boardwalk and a hassle-free walk straight onto the sand. <br>- Inlet Beach Regional Access A bit farther but easy by car! Great for ample parking, lifeguards, and restrooms.\"<br><br>Step Inside ~ <br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Walk into the fully equipped kitchen with ample counter space. <br>- Dining table which seats 4 is located right off the kitchen. Additional seating for 4 is also provided at the kitchen island.<br>- Just past the dining table awaits a private balcony. <br>- Cozy up in the living room, great for mid-day naps, movie nights, or rainy-day board games. <br>- Directly in front of the garage entrance is where you will find the laundry room and the half bath on this floor.<br><br>SECOND FLOOR<br>- Up the stairs we go! Here you'll find a full shared bath with a shower/tub combo at the top of the stairs.<br>- The bunk room features a twin over double bunk. With the cute costal décor this is the perfect room for the kids to hang 10🤙🏻<br>- Right down the hall is a queen bedroom with all the cozy vibes.<br>- Finally, the Primary bedroom features a king bed, plus an ensuite bathroom with spa like walk in shower.<br><br> 🛏️For Rest:<br>Second Floor: Bunk room with Twin over Double (sleeping 3)<br>Second Floor: Queen bedroom<br>Second Floor: Primary bedroom with primary ensuite bathroom.<br>Additional sleeping option: Pull out queen sleeper sofa in living room<br><br>The Essentials. All included in your stay ~ <br>- Leave the beach gear to us: Beach umbrella, towels, and chairs are provided. <br>- Premium full-size bath products in every bathroom/kitchen We provide body wash, shampoo, conditioner, lotion, and hand soap.<br>- Starter Kit: We start you out with essentials like paper towels, toilet paper, dish soap, and laundry pods. <br>- Coffee Time! Fuel up in the mornings with our complimentary coffee and Keurig. <br>- Convenience at Your Fingertips: Full-size washer and dryer, plus a pack n play for your little one, so you don't need to pack one. <br><br>✏️Other things to note:<br>- Parking is available in the driveway for 2 vehicles at the townhome directly in front of the garage door (unit B). There is no street parking available but there is overflow parking in South Prominence. <br>- Minimum age to rent the home is 25.<br>- Apologies, no furry friends are allowed at the home. We appreciate your understanding on this.<br>- Vacation disruptions can be a bummer. While it doesn't happen often, you may experience issues with Wi-Fi or construction on 30A. We are not responsible for any disruptions to the Wi-Fi service or any construction that may affect your experience. Please note that such occurrences are beyond our control, and we appreciate your understanding and patience in these matters. <br><br>This home is proudly managed by Kalos Dwellings. Please reach out if we can help answer any questions for you. <br><br>STR25-204384",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "🌟 *New* Prominence 30A | Heated Pool | Golf Cart | Bikes 🚲"
        }
      ],
